---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund & Return Policy | Life's Little Things">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-8 bg-background text-text">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-title font-bold text-primary">Refund & Return Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg">All sales are final unless otherwise required by law.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Returns</h2>
      <p>We do not accept returns on finished handmade items. If an item arrives damaged or there is a problem with your order, contact us as soon as possible so we can review the issue.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Refunds</h2>
      <p>Refunds are handled case by case and are not guaranteed. If a refund is approved, it will be issued to the original payment method when practical.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Return Shipping</h2>
      <p>If a return is authorized, the customer is responsible for return shipping unless we state otherwise in writing.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>